## Human intervention needed

The automated job failed during `explore/generate_tests()` for `com.sun.xml.ws:policy:4.0.5`. Preserved work is available at https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/tree/ai%2Fkimeta%2Fhuman-intervention%2Fissue-9942-library-new-request-com.sun.xml.ws-policy-4.0.5-242f1400.

